## Adaptation Engine (advisory, `domain/adapt/`)

Pure, unit-testable advisory layer mirroring `TrophyEvaluator`: `AdaptationRepository.snapshot()`
builds an immutable `AdaptationSnapshot` from existing DAOs; advisors are pure functions of it,
emitting `Recommendation`s (stable id + human-readable reason + confidence). **Proposes only —
applying always goes through an existing user-confirmed write path.** Confidence-gated: below
per-signal data thresholds (`AdaptThresholds`, all tunables in one place) an advisor stays silent.
Untracked sessions (#110) are excluded from every signal at snapshot build.

**Phase 1 — shipped (2026-06-09):**
- `ProgressionAdvisor.suggestNextLoad` — double progression for the day-screen suggestion chip:
  weight rises only when every top-weight set hit the range top at acceptable effort; per-set RPE
  outranks the coarse exercise rating; BRUTAL/RPE ≥ 9.5 backs off. **Unit-aware**: dumbbells move
  in 2.5 lb steps (intensity-scaled), PLATES move in whole plates with plate-count input text
  ("4 plates") — fixing the old chip emitting raw lb on plate exercises, which the weight field
  parsed as a plate count (~15× too heavy). The UP NEXT delta pill now reads the advisor's lb
  delta (`suggestedDeltaLb`) instead of re-parsing the suggestion string.
- `ProgressionAdvisor.evaluate` — plateau ladder over the whole program (stall = bouts since last
  e1RM improvement, so a recent PR resets it): 4 stalled → micro-load (low effort) or ~10% reset
  (high effort); 6 → rep-range shift; 8 → variation swap (equipment/dislike-filtered candidates).
  No UI surface yet — consumed by the Overview coach feed in engine Phase 4.
- `E1rm` (Epley), `SnapshotAssembler` (pure grouping), new DAO fan-out queries
  (`allForFinishedSessions` on LoggedExercise/LoggedSet — query-only, no schema change).
- Tests: `domain/adapt/` — 39 tests covering cold start, happy path, conflicting signals
  (top-of-range + brutal, RPE vs rating, PR-resets-stall), unit awareness, determinism.

**Phase 2 — shipped (2026-06-09):**
