## Data Layer

### Database (Room, WAL mode) — **schema v22, 25 entities, migration-locked from v12**
> Every change past v11 needs a real `Migration` in `Migrations.kt` (in `ALL_MIGRATIONS`), a bumped
> version, an exported schema JSON, and a `MigrationTest` case — a bump without a migration fails loudly
> at startup (data is never silently wiped). Full 12→22 chain confirmed on-device (Samsung SM-G998U /
> Android 15, 2026-06-14).

**Core workout**
| Table | Purpose |
|---|---|
| Session | One row per started workout (dayKey, startedAt, finishedAt, sessionType, **active_seconds** v20, journal) |
| SessionSegment | One row per "sitting" of a session (start/end) — sums real ACTIVE time across resume-later (v20) |
| LoggedExercise | One exercise in a session (effortRating, note, skipped, **slot_id** v22 = original slot when swapped) |
| LoggedSet | One set (weight, reps, isPr, rpe, set-type annotations) |
| MoodEntry | Post-workout mood per session |
| RestEvent | Planned vs realized rest per set (how it ended, +seconds) — feeds the adaptive rest timer (v16) |
| SessionBreak | Legacy break tracking |

**Program / customization**
| Table | Purpose |
|---|---|
| ProgramDay / ProgramSlot | Data-driven generated program (days + their exercise slots) (v14) |
| ProgramCustomization | Per-slot set/rep/remove overrides (**source** user/auto v21) |
| ExerciseCustomization | Persistent swaps (name + unit, **source** v21, **swapped_exercise_id** v22) |
| WarmupRoutineItem | User-edited warmup items |
| DayNameOverride | User-renamed day labels |

**Coach / adaptation**
| Table | Purpose |
|---|---|
| CoachPass | One Weekly Coach Pass per ISO week (status shadow/hold/error) (v17) |
| CoachDecision | A pass's proposed/applied/skipped/reverted changes + undo data (v17, lifecycle v19) |
| SuggestionOutcome | Suggested-vs-taken weight per exercise/session — calibrates the weight chip (v18) |
| AdviceEvent | Shown/applied/dismissed per recommendation id — drives 14-day cooldowns (v16) |

**Goals / cardio / trophies / misc**
| Table | Purpose |
|---|---|
| CardioEntry | Cardio logs (type, duration, distance, effort, restReason, note) |
| UnlockedTrophy | Trophy IDs + unlock timestamp |
| TrophyNearMiss | Near-miss tracking (closest-to-unlock) |
| ExerciseGoal / ExtendedGoal | Per-exercise + extended goals |
| BodyweightEntry | Bodyweight log (unique date_key index, v15) |
| VacationPeriod | Named holiday date ranges (bridge streaks, pause the readiness advisor) |
| RestDayEntry | Rest-day records (logic-only; no Stats UI caller) |

### Repositories
- WorkoutRepository — session + set + exercise CRUD, mood + journal recording, active session observe, rest-event logging
- CustomizationRepository — day name overrides, exercise customizations (swaps)
- ProgramRepository — generates/persists the data-driven program; reconcile, re-roll (day + all), widget refresh, coach-bias enrichment
- ProgramCustomizationRepository — per-slot set/rep/remove overrides (with user/auto source)
- TrophyRepository — unlock evaluation + persistence, stats snapshot fan-out, near-miss + max-streak (vacation-bridged)
- CardioRepository — cardio CRUD, weekly minutes flow
- StatsRepository — all stats queries for the Stats tab + `getSessionDetail(id)` (session detail screen)
- AdaptationRepository — the adaptation engine's only impure piece: `snapshot()` fan-out, `readinessScale()`, `coachRecommendations()`, `engineStatsRead()`, `insights()`, `applyDeloadWeek()`, advice logging
- CoachRepository — the Weekly Coach Pass orchestration: `ensureWeeklyPass`, `brief`, apply/skip/undo/applyAll, autopilot, markSeen
- ProfileRepository — fan-out read assembling the "You" hub snapshot (rank/XP/standing/signature) + runs `domain/rank/` engines
- ProgressPhotoRepository / AvatarRepository — physique photos + avatar in app-private storage (`filesDir/`, JSON index — **no Room table / no migration**)
- VacationRepository — holiday date ranges
- BackupRepository — whole-DB-file backup + restore. **Also backs up app settings** (#138): a backup is now a ZIP of the Room DB + DataStore preferences file; restore sniffs ZIP vs raw DB and stages `pending_restore.db` / `pending_restore_prefs.pb`, swapped in at boot by `ForgeApp.applyPendingRestore()` before Room/DataStore is first opened. `VACUUM INTO` → WAL-checkpoint+copy fallback for pre-Android-11. The lossy JSON/CSV exports (`exportFullDataJson`/sessions/weekly) now open the **system share sheet** via a `FileProvider` with fixed overwrite filenames (no more timestamped pile-up)

### Preferences (DataStore)
- **Onboarding/identity:** `onboarding_done`, `user_name`, `user_goal`, `user_sex` (`welcomed` is legacy)
- **Appearance:** `accent_color_hex`, `accent_emphasis` (Off/Subtle/Medium/Strong), `amoled_mode`, `font_choice`, `day_color_$dayKey`
- **Units/format:** `use_kg`, `plate_weight_lb` (configurable plate weight), `date_format`, `timezone`, `time_format_24h`, `first_day_monday`
- **Program:** `days_per_week`, `program_emphasis`, `program_experience`, `priority_muscles`, `problem_areas`, `frozen_exercise_ids` (curated preset freeze), `max_db_weight_lb` (heaviest dumbbell ceiling), rotation/`schedule_mode`+`schedule_weekly` (weekday plan), `deload_week_start_ms`, `planned_next_day`, `warmup_$dayKey`
- **Coach:** `coach_mode` (suggest/auto), `last_seen_coach_week_id`
- **Misc:** `cardio_weekly_target_min`, `monthly_pr_target`, `haptic_strength`, `privacy_mode`, quiet-hours, `compact_set_logging`
- (Retired: `lastDeloadAtSessionCount` — the fixed deload counter was deleted when the DeloadAdvisor replaced it)

### Domain Utilities & Engines
- PrDetector — compares new set against historical max
- VolumeCalculator — weight × reps per set → total lb; `WeightFormatter` (locale-safe `formatVolume`/`formatVolumeCompact`)
- WeightParser — parses weight text to Double lb ("45", "2 plates", "BW", "45lb"); a bare number on a PLATES exercise = plate count × configurable plate weight
- TrophyEvaluator — pure function, stats snapshot → set of unlocked trophy IDs
- RestTimerController — wall-clock countdown state machine (end-instant via injected `Clock`; start / pause / resume / reset / stop)
- **Pure engine packages:** `domain/adapt/` (6 advisors + arbiter), `domain/coach/` (5 systems + gen-bias), `domain/rank/` (XpEngine / RankLadder / StandingEngine), `domain/schedule/WeeklySchedule`, `domain/vacation/VacationCalendar` — all deterministic, snapshot-fed, unit-tested

### DI
- Hilt throughout (ViewModels, Repositories, DAOs, Clock)
- Clock abstraction (SystemClock + fakeable for tests)

